"type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob08re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "What is a Pamphlet?", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Pamphlets should be used when you want to give people more information than you can put on a poster.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Health pamphlet", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Educational pamphlet", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Advertising pamphlet", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Pamphlets can </p> <ul><li>explain an issue to the community like health and wellness</li><li> inform people of their rights</li> <li>win support for a cause</li></ul> Pamphlets are a simple way of providing information.", "type": "text"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Requesting and Giving Advice", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "When you ask for and give advice, you often use modal verbs.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"strong\">Simon</span>: What do you suggest for jet lag?</br> <span class=\"strong\">Laura</span>: Drink lots of water. You don't want to get dehydrated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Asking for Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Giving Advice\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What do you think I should do?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What about \u2026 ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What should I do?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Why don't you \u2026 ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">What do you suggest?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">One option is to \u2026</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Do you think I should \u2026</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You should \u2026</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "jet lag", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a tired and unpleasant feeling that you sometimes get when you travel by airplane ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I suffered terrible jet lag after my flight from Asia. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob08aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about health.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fluid", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a liquid substance", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Make sure you drink plenty of fluids.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob08aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "dehydrated", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to lose too much water", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Flying can make you dehydrated.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob08aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "circulation", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the movement of blood through the body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You need to maintain good blood circulation.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob08aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "cramped", "type": "name"}, {"content": "not having enough space ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The seats are so cramped.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob08aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "stretch", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the act of stretching your body", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Doing leg stretches at the back of the plane can help.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob08aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "aisle", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a passage between seats to walk", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Walking up and down the aisle is a good idea.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob08aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "memory", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the ability to recall the past", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Jet lag can affect your memory.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le14ob08aud08", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Find 3 health pamphlets online or in your neighborhood in English.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read the pamphlets.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write down notes about the pamphlets like <span class=\"italic\">definition</span>, <span class=\"italic\">symptoms</span> and <span class=\"italic\">treatment</span>.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose one pamphlet and give a presentation to a partner on the information.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I find three health pamphlets online or in my area.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I write notes on health information.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I give a presentation on the information in a health pamphlet.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le14ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Excuse me, could I get some advice?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Sure, what can I help you with?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: I am on the next flight to the States. I am a little concerned about jet lag.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: We have some pamphlets here on travel and your health. Why don't you take one of these?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh wonderful, thanks."}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob08re2img02.jpg", "time": "16500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: The pamphlet includes some helpful tips and ideas.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Like what?</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Well, you should drink plenty of fluids before and while you are in the air.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes, you don't want to get dehydrated.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: No, and it's a good idea to move around as much as you can during the flight.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What do you suggest?"}, {"image": "engenn5le14ob08re2img05.jpg", "time": "34300", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Walking up and down the aisle and doing some stretches at the back of the plane can help with your circulation.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Those seats on the airplane are so small and cramped!</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Yes, try to get some rest on the flight so you aren't too tired when you arrive at your destination.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, I can hear them calling my flight number. Thanks for the pamphlet.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Tom</span>: Safe travels.</br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Shokran!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le14ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le14ob08re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "video", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "", "time": "6000", "id": 1, "text": "A Health Pamphlet on Jet Lag"}, {"image": "", "time": "11000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What is it?"}, {"image": "", "time": "32000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">What are the symptoms?"}, {"image": "", "time": "47000", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"bullet\">Treatment"}], "video_src": "engenn5le14ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "id": 2}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "engenn5le14ob08re4aud01", "type": "audio"}], "id": 3}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "text", "contents": [{"value": "engenn5le14ob08re6aud04", "type": "audio"}], "id": 4}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can write a small pamphlet.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can write about common health problems. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can give advice. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What does being jet-lagged mean? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What should you do to prevent jet lag?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2